---
title: "Deleting an item, shown at once"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: done
    lg1: error
    lg2: active
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 blue
  s0: Item listed
  s1: Confirm dialog open
  s2: Row hidden while deleting
  s3: Item gone, toast shown
  s4: Row back, error toast
  s5: Row back, changed-item alert
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you press Delete
  s1 --> s0: you cancel
  s1 --> s2: you confirm
  s2 --> s3: the delete succeeds
  s2 --> s4: the request fails
  s2 --> s5: the item changed meanwhile (412)
  s4 --> s1: you press Delete
  s5 --> s1: you press Delete
  s1 --> s4: you cancel
  s1 --> s5: you cancel
  class s0 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 teal
  class s4 orange
  class s5 orange
